manifest recipe (headers only). The tarball root carries CL/*.h (no
include/ prefix); manifest "CL:include/CL" drops them into the package
include tree, which SymlinkProgram links into /System/Index/include so
clinfo's -I/System/Index/include resolves <CL/cl.h>.

Build order: OpenCL-Headers -> Clinfo. No runtime deps. The NVIDIA ICD at
runtime is provided by the Nvidia recipe (libOpenCL.so.1 loader +
libnvidia-opencl.so.1 via nvidia.icd).
